---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About — Lauren Wynne"
  description="About Lauren Wynne — designer, former data scientist, AI design lead."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8">
    <h1>About</h1>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        I'm a product designer who came up through data science. I spent years
        building models and teaching Python before pivoting into design — which
        means I treat AI features as design problems with statistical
        constraints, not magic.
      </p>
      <p>
        Today I lead design for AI products: tools that help non-experts work
        with models, surface uncertainty honestly, and earn trust through
        legibility instead of hype.
      </p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="mt-16">Background</h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[var(--color-muted)]">
      <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">AI Design Lead</strong> — current</li>
      <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Senior Product Designer</strong> — earlier roles in enterprise data tooling</li>
      <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Adjunct Lecturer</strong> — Python instruction</li>
      <li><strong class="text-[var(--color-ink)]">Data Scientist</strong> — earlier career in research</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="mt-16">Get in touch</h2>
    <p class="mt-4">
      Email me at
      <a href="mailto:hello@laurenwynne.com" class="underline underline-offset-4">
        hello@laurenwynne.com
      </a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
